# Editing app chrome

- Stay in `app/components`. Do not move these files into `respond-ui`.
- This folder is for route/navigation chrome and native/platform loaders — not visual design-system primitives.
- i18n (`tx`), navigation, keyboard, and safe-area props are allowed here.
- Visual pieces and tokens come from `respond-ui`. No new hex.
